					"nextDialogs": [
						750351218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750351218,
					"content": "呀！呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750351219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750351219,
					"content": "不过，放了太久的料理不能吃哦，不管是我们还是你，吃了都会弄坏肚子的，所以这个得先处理掉…",
